        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bohan Hyland & Associates are delighted to present Apartment 40, Westend Gate to market for sale. This two-bedroom, two bathroom second floor apartment comes to market presented in good condition with one designated parking space underground.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first time buyers, people downsizing and investors alike and is ideally located in the ever-popular Westend Gate development which is close to all local amenities (shops, bars, restaurants, parks, bus routes, LUAS) and is within walking distance of The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght University Hospital, Tallaght Stadium & IT Tallaght. Westend Gate is adjacent to the N81 and just minutes from the M50 & N7 road networks.\r\n\r\nThis apartment briefly comprises of an open plan living room/kitchen, two double bedrooms and two bathrooms. Many additional benefits include, electric storage heating, balcony and fitted wardrobes to name but a few.\r\n\r\n2026 Service Charge: €2108\r\n\r\nTo view this property call Shane Hanevy today on 01 491 3000."
      },
